          "zh": "图{overlay} 是图{source} 的标注版，紫色半透明高亮标出的区域是要修改的范围。只修改图{source} 中高亮区域内的内容，高亮区域之外的所有内容保持完全不变，输出图里不要出现紫色高亮。",
          "en": "Image {overlay} is an annotated copy of Image {source}; the translucent purple highlight marks the area to modify. Only change the content inside the highlighted area of Image {source}, keep everything outside it exactly unchanged, and do not show the purple highlight in the output."
